&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;What in the Name of Fucking Terra On Roller Skates is this?
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;The Emperor&amp;#39;s Janitors have to have some way to keep from losing more of their GLORIOUS warrior past. They maintain that blood lust (and maybe other lusts) high by oiling up and demolishing lesser creatures.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Includes 3 lineman poses, a blitzer pose, a catcher pose, and a catcher pose.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Many more to follow so you can irritate opponents who take their lore too seriously. I (or OrionRS as the fabstodes line is somewhat of a shared project) plan to make an fab ogre as an option for the team in the near future.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Note: I included a cylinder and a punch dagger that can be used to diametrically size any weapons you want to put in their hands. I have no clue about blood bowl at all so don&amp;#39;t know if the held weapons mean anything.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Second Note: Thanks to tomleech for the inspiration and incentive to make these guys.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;UPDATE: Issue with the thin unprintable footballs fixed. Use receiver fixed and QB fixed
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
